[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（英音）]
[ti:Not a Gold Mine]
[00:11.94]What did the team find?
[00:16.50]Dreams of finding lost treasure almost came true recently.
[00:21.80]A new machine called 'The Revealer' has been invented
[00:26.96]and it has been used to detect gold which has been buried in the ground.
[00:33.14]The machine was used in a cave near the seashore where --it is said--pirates used to hide gold.
[00:42.78]The pirates would often bury gold in the cave and then fail to collect it.
[00:49.66]Armed with the new machine, a search party went into the cave hoping to find buried treasure.
[00:58.37]The leader of the party was examining the soil near the entrance to the cave when the machine showed that there was gold under the ground.
[01:09.19]Very excited, the party dug a hole two feet deep.
[01:15.54]They finally found a small gold coin which was almost worthless.
[01:21.31]The party then searched the whole cave thoroughly but did not find anything
[01:26.79]except an empty tin trunk.
[01:28.32]In spite of this, many people are confident that
[01:33.45]'The Revealer' may reveal something of value fairly soon.
